{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分感受词存在语义重复，例如船体托举、漂浮、水波摇荡等意象连续铺陈，容易从细腻变成堆叠；X的连续叙事读起来更顺。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮关键词能让观众迅速抓住每段心理变化，叙事句也更凝练；感受按音乐实际进程出现，则让观众不必一次读完所有提示，还能逐步捕捉情绪和音乐细节。尤其从怕给对方添负担，到确认对方没有退开，再到害怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢，Y把心理转变及其原因呈现得更具体；不过X的连续叙述在整体阅读流畅度上略有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad9fbb48-04c5-4bb5-a914-206f00189a8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000641442210Z", "elapsed_seconds": 117.532, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:08:38.991271+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1c006be812511a2c5951cda19a709153f0d6e47e7afdb4122a41e92f0c73e915", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23